flowchart TD
    %% See doc/data-flow/FLOWCHART_SYMBOLS.md for symbol meanings

    G[Guest]
    PV((Product List + Detail))
    GCV((Guest Checkout View))
    GSV((Guest Success Page))
    PP[PayPal Sandbox]

    PC((ProductController))
    GCC((GuestCheckoutController))
    GPC((GuestPaymentController))
    TS((TransactionService))

    DB[(Products / Transactions / Cards / Users)]

    G --> PV --> PC --> DB
    DB --> PC --> PV

    %% Guest card flow
    G --> GCV --> GCC --> TS --> DB
    DB --> TS --> GCC --> GSV

    %% Guest PayPal flow
    GCC --> GPC --> PP --> GPC --> TS --> DB
    DB --> TS --> GPC --> GSV
